{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u201cSamurai Conqueror\u201d</strong> is an epic historical strategy game where you aim to unify Japan across time \u2014 from the ancient Kofun period to the transformative Meiji era.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Set against the sweeping backdrop of Japan\u2019s full historical timeline, you\u2019ll choose one legendary figure to lead your faction and strive to bring all of Japan under your rule.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Develop your domain through commerce, agriculture, technology, and military might.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wage war against rival factions, expand your realm, and reshape the course of Japanese history.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Will you be the one to unify the ages?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose one historical figure from Japanese history and start the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Strengthen your faction\u2019s commerce, agriculture, technology, and military power with development commands.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Invade other factions and expand your territory. Aim to unify Japanese history!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3430910?t=1742696809","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3430910?t=1742696809","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430910/949202cf77f3e3aafb79a9f11ca53016a9c271cd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742696809","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430910/949202cf77f3e3aafb79a9f11ca53016a9c271cd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742696809","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u201cSamurai Conqueror\u201d</strong> is an epic historical strategy game where you aim to unify Japan across time \u2014 from the ancient Kofun period to the transformative Meiji era.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Set against the sweeping backdrop of Japan\u2019s full historical timeline, you\u2019ll choose one legendary figure to lead your faction and strive to bring all of Japan under your rule.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Develop your domain through commerce, agriculture, technology, and military might.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wage war against rival factions, expand your realm, and reshape the course of Japanese history.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Will you be the one to unify the ages?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose one historical figure from Japanese history and start the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Strengthen your faction\u2019s commerce, agriculture, technology, and military power with development commands.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Invade other factions and expand your territory. Aim to unify Japanese history!</p></li></ul>","developers":["Miura Production"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3430910/c8f0f06650a1fe54303ef79b11e9f2cf48304540/header.jpg?t=1742696809","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"(c) Miura Production","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 10.12+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.0GHz+<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 MB RAM</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257109153,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257109153/movie480.mp4?t=1740988156","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2571